        "vectra_esg_UhiTn6": {
          "type": "vectra-esg",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "hide_section": false,
            "kicker": "OUR EXPERIENCE",
            "heading": "20+ Years of Experience You Can Rely On",
            "text": "VECTRA International was founded in 2005. But the experience behind our work goes back further than that, because the people doing it had already spent years, in some cases decades, in these exact situations before they ever became a team.\n\nVECTRA International has worked with organizations across responsible business, supply chains, workplace standards, and operational improvement. That's not a number on a slide. It's why we already know where change tends to stall, what actually helps people move it forward, and why even a good plan still has to survive contact with a Monday morning.\n\nToday, we bring that experience to a broader role in business resilience and operational capability building, helping organizations make stronger decisions, build stronger teams, and create improvements they can sustain.",
